 "remarks": "Location, Location, Location! Welcome to this bright and well-appointed condo in the heart of downtown, where convenience is truly at your doorstep. Enjoy being within walking distance of shopping, dining, entertainment, and everything the downtown area has to offer. The sunny living room features an attached private balcony, creating a comfortable space to relax or entertain. The unit also offers generous closet space, a well-equipped kitchen, dining area, comfortable bedroom, and full bathroom-everything you need for easy, convenient living. Even better, heat, hot water, and cooking gas are included, helping keep monthly expenses predictable. The property also includes a dedicated storage unit conveniently located on the main floor. A fantastic location, practical layout, and valuable included amenities make this condo a great opportunity. Come see it before it's gone!",
